%abc-2.1
X: 1779315391
T: The Ken Meadows Waltz
C: Martin Matthews
Z: Cam Cross
R: waltz
M: 3/4
Q: 1/4=115
K: Amaj
N: Beautiful tune. From the composer: "Written by me for our dear friend Ken RIP." 
N: This is what I think is the core of the tune, but in the recording, the players sometimes repeat the 
N: first half of the B-part. I also have a low version of the A-part, which I think works nice as an intro.
S: https://youtu.be/xUGGWFjmhIs?si=cV12vCI8reGJtosy
